{
  "uid": "bench-overview",
  "title": "Bench — Overview",
  "description": "All three workflow engines side by side: what is waiting, what is moving, what it costs, and whether the signal can be believed.",
  "tags": [
    "bench",
    "overview"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": false,
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Bench dashboards",
      "type": "dashboards",
      "tags": [
        "bench"
      ],
      "asDropdown": true,
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": true,
      "targetBlank": false,
      "icon": "external link",
      "tooltip": "Every bench dashboard",
      "url": ""
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "ds",
        "label": "Datasource",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {
          "text": "bench-prometheus",
          "value": "bench-prometheus"
        },
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Temporal",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Queue depth",
      "description": "Backlog per task queue and task type: temporal_taskqueue_backlog_count{namespace=\"default\"}, written by a textfile poller on bench-temporal (job node, instance bench-temporal:9100) because the server's own approximate_backlog_count stops being exported once matching unloads an idle task-queue partition — exactly when a parked job is the only thing left to see.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 7,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "dashed"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "links": [
            {
              "title": "Open Temporal dashboard",
              "url": "/d/bench-temporal",
              "targetBlank": false
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "max by (task_queue, task_type) (temporal_taskqueue_backlog_count{namespace=\"default\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{task_queue}} / {{task_type}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Throughput",
      "description": "Completions per second from the Temporal server's own Prometheus endpoint (job temporal): workflow_success and activity_success, both excluding the temporal_system namespace. These are server-side completion counters, so they move only when work actually finishes.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 7,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(workflow_success{namespace!=\"temporal_system\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "workflows/s",
          "refId": "A",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "sum(rate(activity_success{namespace!=\"temporal_system\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "activities/s",
          "refId": "B",
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "gauge",
      "title": "RAM vs cap",
      "description": "Working set as a percentage of the 1536 MiB Incus cap: (incus_memory_MemTotal_bytes - incus_memory_MemAvailable_bytes) / incus_memory_MemTotal_bytes for name=\"bench-temporal\", job incus. Cgroup view, so page cache charged to the guest counts.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 3,
        "x": 15,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 70
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 90
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showThresholdLabels": false,
        "showThresholdMarkers": true,
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "100 * (incus_memory_MemTotal_bytes{name=\"bench-temporal\"} - incus_memory_MemAvailable_bytes{name=\"bench-temporal\"}) / incus_memory_MemTotal_bytes{name=\"bench-temporal\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{name}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Working set",
      "description": "Absolute working set in bytes: incus_memory_MemTotal_bytes - incus_memory_MemAvailable_bytes for name=\"bench-temporal\" (job incus), against a 1536 MiB cap. Temporal's history cache grows under load and does not return to its idle figure, so read this next to the gauge.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 3,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "value",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "incus_memory_MemTotal_bytes{name=\"bench-temporal\"} - incus_memory_MemAvailable_bytes{name=\"bench-temporal\"}",
          "legendFormat": "working set",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Signal health",
      "description": "Is Temporal's queue-depth reading trustworthy right now: up{job=\"temporal\"} for the engine's own metrics endpoint, and temporal_poller_up for the textfile poller that supplies the backlog gauge. Depth is only believable when both read OK.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${ds}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 3,
        "x": 21,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "DOWN",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "OK",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "up{job=\"temporal\"}",
          "legendFormat": "engine",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${ds}"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "temporal_poller_up",
          "legendFormat": "poller",
          "refId": "B",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ]
    },
